<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus triumphant, through the fleeting years;</l><l>Jesus triumphant, spite of blinding tears;</l><l>High over all, to hear Thy loving voice,</l><l>Which bids the heart look upward and rejoice.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus triumphant, when in work for Thee,</l><l>Sad and disheartened, no results we see;</l><l>When gathered force of evil seems to win,</l><l>And work for Christ seems lost in work of sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus triumphant all along the line;</l><l>Triumphant Savior, all Thy triumph mine;</l><l>For since I am a partner in Thy love,</l><l>My life on earth is lived through Thee above.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus triumphant when the spirit wings</l><l>Onward and upward to the King of kings;</l><l>And through the last great triumph of Thy grace</l><l>Triumphant saints shall see Thee face to face.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
